      "id": "weekly-upstream-20261101",
      "notes": "GLM5.3 chat families use low/high/max; shared levels round lower-first/higher fallback and none maps to low with warning. Explicit provider reasoningEffort accepts high/none/low/max and passes through unchanged for configurable models. Conversations retains exact model whitelist and none/high efforts independently of Chat defaults; unknown or chat-only models warn unsupported. Native apiKeyProvider rotates keys for language/conversation/embedding/transcription/speech HTTP operations. Reviewed upstream: @ai-sdk/mistral 4.0.72 to 4.0.77. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning package suites and the compatibility facade); node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); docs-site check and build (100 pages). Live provider calls were not run.",
      "compatibility": "Minor release for additive native API; existing static settings and call sites remain compatible. Updated direct dependency minimums are recorded in the manifest. Existing documented JS/framework and native product gaps remain; version-delta review does not imply full parity or live-service testing. Explicit custom authentication skips an unused credential supplier, a deliberate native callback-order adaptation."
    }
  ],
